      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SERRATED EDGE (8) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at The Meadows over 525m behind Heathcote Rupee (31.02) in a Grade 5. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has ability and is a key runner. RED TURTLE (6) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 24.34 beating Hard Launch. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. One of the prime contenders. CRUISIN' GRAE (1) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 5th (23.25) at Geelong. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Great chance to atone. CANDY POPS (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
